### MUTATES DATA: create simulated moisture sensor
POST {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buildingId": "{{testBuildingId}}",
  "unitId": "{{testUnitId}}",
  "externalId": "http-client-moisture-{{$random.uuid}}",
  "name": "HTTP Client unit 101 sensor"
}

> {% client.global.set("testSensorId", response.body.id); %}

### List moisture sensors
GET {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors?buildingId={{testBuildingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Get moisture sensor
GET {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors/{{testSensorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: update moisture sensor
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors/{{testSensorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP Client unit 101 moisture sensor",
  "status": "online"
}

### MUTATES DATA: ingest dry sensor event
POST {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors/{{testSensorId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "dry",
  "measuredAt": "2026-07-05T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### MUTATES DATA: ingest wet sensor event
POST {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors/{{testSensorId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "wet",
  "measuredAt": "2026-07-05T12:15:00.000Z"
}

### List immutable sensor events
GET {{baseUrl}}/moisture-sensors/{{testSensorId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Get correlation settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/incident-correlation-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### MUTATES DATA: update correlation window
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/incident-correlation-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moistureCorrelationWindowMinutes": 30
}
